# Source placement

Use AGENTS.md and docs/knowledge/architecture.md for the module map.
Under src/mission_control:

| Group | Ownership |
| --- | --- |
| contracts | Public wire models and contract vocabulary |
| domain | Pure invariants, interpreters and deterministic decisions |
| application | Admission, commands, use cases and ports |
| adapters | PostgreSQL, Temporal, bounded harnesses and SDKs |
| interfaces | HTTP/MCP/CLI transport |
| bootstrap | Trusted configuration, wiring and entrypoints |

Do not duplicate contracts or schedulers. Domain cannot import provider SDKs.
Preserve behavior using reducer, persistence and runtime tests.
